# Our hand-written C/C++ only (port/kz3, port/spu, port/vfs, tools/**/*.c), checked on changed files by tools/lint.sh.
# Not applied to port/patches (they follow upstream ps3recomp's style), generated code or third_party.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120
BreakBeforeBraces: Linux
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: true
PointerAlignment: Left
SortIncludes: Never
ReflowComments: false
